sequenceDiagram
  participant Policy
  participant Approval
  participant Tool as Tool Gateway
  participant Broker as Credential Broker
  participant Adapter
  participant Target
  Tool->>Policy: authorization tuple
  Policy-->>Tool: permit + credential profile
  opt approval required
    Tool->>Approval: resolve action digest
    Approval-->>Tool: approved one-shot record
  end
  Tool->>Broker: request bound opaque handle
  Broker-->>Adapter: proxy session or sealed memory credential
  Tool->>Adapter: invoke fixed operation
  Adapter->>Target: target-limited authenticated action
  Target-->>Adapter: synthetic result
  Adapter-->>Tool: redacted result
  Tool->>Broker: revoke/close session
